@startuml activity
' Activity Diagram - Booking flow with swimlanes
title Hospital Home-Care System - Booking Activity Diagram

|End User|
start
:Open App;
if (Logged in?) then (No)
    repeat
        :Login via Email / OAuth;
    repeat while (Auth success?) is (No) not (Yes)
else (Yes)
endif
:View Service Catalog;
:Select service\n(Post-op / Pre-op / Elderly care);
:Choose self / family member;
:Choose time slot (e.g. 8am-8pm);
:Add special demands (optional);
:Submit booking request;

|Admin|
:Receive booking request;
while (Demands feasible?) is (No)
    :Contact user to adjust;
endwhile (Yes)
:Arrange nurse OFFLINE\n(outside system);
:Record assigned nurse\n+ confirm booking;

|End User|
:Notified - booking confirmed;
:Track service status;
stop

@enduml
